{"id":"f0f48d6bfc7c7bfb","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-mincomplexity.md","title":"NP-hardness of DNF minimization","display":"thm-mincomplexity — NP-hardness of DNF minimization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-mincomplexity","aliases":["27-thm-mincomplexity"],"display":"thm-mincomplexity — NP-hardness of DNF minimization","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-encoding]]","[[27-df-classNP]]","[[27-df-polyred]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§3.3.3 Theorem 3.14 and following DNF-input consequence","source_printed_pages":"155–156","source_pdf_pages":"179–180","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-decision-formulation-proof-not-audited","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-mincomplexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-mincomplexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mincomplexity — NP-hardness of DNF minimization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f8a4092aca6c1520\" href=\"?note=f8a4092aca6c1520\" title=\"27-df-classNP\">27-df-classNP</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b12857db11f1d566\" href=\"?note=b12857db11f1d566\" title=\"27-df-polyred\">27-df-polyred</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.3.3 Theorem 3.14 and following DNF-input consequence"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"155–156"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"179–180"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-decision-formulation-proof-not-audited"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{encDNF},\\mathrm{pair}\">\\(\\mathrm{encDNF},\\mathrm{pair}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*\\)</span> 由下节构造；非空字串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的坐标域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[|u|]\">\\([|u|]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示下式已断言存在唯一的对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP},\\leq_p\">\\(\\mathbf{NP},\\leq_p\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f8a4092aca6c1520\" href=\"?note=f8a4092aca6c1520\" title=\"27-df-classNP\">27-df-classNP</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b12857db11f1d566\" href=\"?note=b12857db11f1d566\" title=\"27-df-polyred\">27-df-polyred</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MINDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{MINDNF}\\)</span> 为下式定义的二进制决策语言符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists!u\\in\\mathbb B^*\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\;\\left(u_1=1\\land k=\\sum_{i=1}^{|u|}u_i2^{|u|-i}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists!u\\in\\mathbb B^*\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\;\\left(u_1=1\\land k=\\sum_{i=1}^{|u|}u_i2^{|u|-i}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)\\coloneqq\\{(1,0)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{bin}(k)\\coloneqq\\iota u\\in\\mathbb B^*\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\;\\left(u_1=1\\land k=\\sum_{i=1}^{|u|}u_i2^{|u|-i}\\right)\\quad(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bin}(0)\\coloneqq\\{(1,0)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{bin}(k)\\coloneqq\\iota u\\in\\mathbb B^*\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\;\\left(u_1=1\\land k=\\sum_{i=1}^{|u|}u_i2^{|u|-i}\\right)\\quad(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MINDNF}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{pair}(\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D),\\operatorname{bin}(k))\\mid n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\exists E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\land|E|\\leq k)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MINDNF}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{pair}(\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D),\\operatorname{bin}(k))\\mid n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\exists E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\land|E|\\leq k)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\;(L\\leq_p\\mathrm{MINDNF}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\;(L\\leq_p\\mathrm{MINDNF}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仅断言 NP-hard，不由“猜一个短 DNF”误推 NP membership：等价性验证本身可能困难。原书 §3.3.3 讨论多种输入表示下的最优化复杂性；本原子固定任意 DNF 输入与项数界的决策版本。Theorem 3.14 的 bounded-column set-cover 归约及随后 true-point→minterm-DNF 转换给出此陈述；最优项数恰为强制项数加 set-cover 最优值，故阈值版同步归约。未重审完整构造的每个技术引理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-classNP","status":"resolved","id":"f8a4092aca6c1520","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-classNP]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-polyred","status":"resolved","id":"b12857db11f1d566","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-polyred]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]；$\\mathrm{encDNF},\\mathrm{pair}$ 见 [[27-df-encoding]]，$\\oper